me'),\n    rateQuantity: Quantity.optional().describe('Amount of medication per unit of time')\n  })).optional().describe('Amount of medication administered'),\n  maxDosePerPeriod: Ratio.optional().describe('Upper limit on medication per unit of time'),\n  maxDosePerAdministration: Quantity.optional().describe('Upper limit on medication per administration'),\n  maxDosePerLifetime: Quantity.optional().describe('Upper limit on medication per lifetime of the patient')\n}).describe('How the medication is/was taken or should be taken');","action":"modified"}}
