duction Ready**: Efficient performance suitable for real-world use\n\n### 6. **Updated Documentation**\n\n\nI've expanded the project's documentation to provide clear guidance for data engineers. The updated materials include detailed understanding notes, practical usage examples, and processing recommendations based on validated performance metrics. These resources will help teams effectively leverage the new FHIR schema tooling for healthcare data processing."}}
